            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixes around the Accessibility permission</h3>
<ul>
  <li>The app now appears in the Accessibility list when you go to grant it. It
    could be missing from there entirely, leaving nothing to tick.</li>
  <li>Revoking the permission is noticed. The menu used to go on saying the app
    was active while nothing worked.</li>
  <li>The menu bar icon is crossed out once the trial ends, so the app says what
    state it is in without being asked.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
